msgctxt "64"
msgid "(There she is. What is she up to...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Nice seein' ya, little lady. Forgot to mention a teensy tiny\r\n"
"something earlier: If you spot a cop strolling over towards\r\n"
"you, turn heel and casually go the other way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Huh? Why? I'm not doing anything illegal, am I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Oh, no no no! Not at all! There are just, uh... laws about\r\n"
"how much a kid your age is allowed to make. Truth is,\r\n"
"we're payin' you even more than we're supposed to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"But hey, you need the dough, we need the help. Win-win, you\r\n"
"know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr "Credo di sì..."

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Anyways, just do what ya did this afternoon and it'll be blue skies and "
"green pastures from now on. Green, like the cash you're gonna rake in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Hey, yeah. We got the stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Girl's chillin' by a vending machine in the parking lot.\r\n"
"Hand her the stacks and she'll give you what you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Here, gimme one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Shit, a copper!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Let's just see what happens, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Heh, kid's got a good head on her shoulders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Donut-eatin' bastard didn't suspect a damn thing. Plus even\r\n"
"if they did catch the girl, we'd still be flyin' sky-high.\r\n"
"Phone's registered to a fake name, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I'd take this over some creepy-ass dark web shit any day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "You're a friggin' genius, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"That was just what we're lookin' for, kid. Ya might even earn yourself a "
"nice little bonus if ya keep puttin' the coppers off your tail like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Oh... Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"You betcha. Anyways, when a customer comes, ya give 'em the\r\n"
"envelope and take the two grand. If a cop comes, ya give 'em the slip. Pretty simple, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "We'll check back in later. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Thanks..."
msgstr "Grazie..."

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"(These are the same guys I saw Haruka with earlier. Mikio\r\n"
"must have been talking about them, too. Guess I'm gonna have\r\n"
"to ask Haruka about this directly...)"
msgstr ""

